{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_29183","headline":"和河南杨少尹奉陪薛司空石笋诗 · 许浑","name":"和河南杨少尹奉陪薛司空石笋诗","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"暖溪寒井碧岩前，谢傅宾朋盛绮筵。\n云断石峰高竝笋，日临山势远开莲。\n闲留幢节低春水，醉拥笙歌出暮烟。\n闻道诗成归已夕，柳风花露月初圆。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"许浑","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_29183.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_29183","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}